# Momentum Dashboard needs NO API keys to work.
#
# Weather uses Open-Meteo (keyless). Quotes ship with the extension.
# Optional keys (OpenWeather, Unsplash, Pexels) are entered by the user in
# Settings -> API keys and stored only in chrome.storage.local on their device.
#
# Never put real keys in NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables: they are inlined into the
# public JavaScript bundle. The variables below are only for local development.
#
# Dev server port (pnpm dev) — optional
# PORT=5000
